{"unit_id":"oka-rin__dsh-qq#card-zh","repo":"oka-rin/dsh-qq","commit":"ab24724234d3740cfb607736e90acf8cc2cb733b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-qq 是一款将 QQ 机器人接入 DSH 网页端的插件。它挂载 QQ 机器人管理面板，并把状态、群成员、会话记录、消息发送和人物档案等操作注册为 DSH 工具。机器人通过 OneBot HTTP 接口执行操作、通过 WebSocket 接收事件；历史消息可按关键词、会话、发言人和时间检索。适合需要在 DSH 中连接和管理 QQ 群聊、查看聊天记录或控制机器人回复的用户。模型回复使用可配置的 OpenAI 兼容接口，默认配置为 DeepSeek；还需配置可连接的 OneBot 后端。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:681-723","client.js:1-7","cordis.patch.yml:1-7"]}
{"unit_id":"oka-rin__dsh-qq#card-en","repo":"oka-rin/dsh-qq","commit":"ab24724234d3740cfb607736e90acf8cc2cb733b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-qq connects a QQ bot to DSH with a management panel and tools for status, groups, chat history, and messaging. It uses OneBot HTTP and WebSocket. Replies use a configurable OpenAI-compatible model endpoint, defaulting to DeepSeek; a OneBot backend is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:681-723","client.js:1-7","cordis.patch.yml:1-7"]}
